## Security Notice

This software handles real user funds. Before deploying to mainnet:
1. Obtain multiple independent security audits
2. Test extensively on devnet
3. Set up a bug bounty program
4. Have emergency response procedures
5. Consider insurance coverage

Deploying unaudited smart contracts can result in total loss of user funds.
